title: "Remove a profile picture"
icon: x
description: "Remove a profile picture: resetAccountProfilePicture in the TypeScript, Python and Rust clients."
---

`DELETE /v1/account/profile-picture`

Removes the authenticated account's custom profile picture and returns the account using its default picture. This operation does not upload a replacement; use the upload-and-commit operations when setting a new custom picture. Supply the required Idempotency-Key header.

<Tabs>
<Tab title="TypeScript">
```typescript TypeScript
photon.account.resetProfilePicture(input: ResetAccountProfilePictureInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<ResetAccountProfilePictureOutput>
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Python">
```python Python
photon.account.reset_profile_picture(input: ResetAccountProfilePictureInput) -> models.Account
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Rust">
```rust Rust
client.reset_account_profile_picture(idempotency_key: String).await -> Result<ResponseValue<types::Account>, Error<ResetAccountProfilePictureError>>
```
</Tab>
</Tabs>

<RequestExample>
```typescript TypeScript
import { Photon } from "@photon-ai/api";

const photon = new Photon({
  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${process.env.PHOTON_API_TOKEN}` },
});
const result = await photon.account.resetProfilePicture({
  headers: {
    idempotencyKey: "idempotencyKey",
  },
});
```

```python Python
import os

from photon_api import Photon
from photon_api.rpc_generated import ResetAccountProfilePictureInput

photon = Photon(headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {os.environ['PHOTON_API_TOKEN']}"})
result = photon.account.reset_profile_picture(
    ResetAccountProfilePictureInput.model_validate({
        "headers": {
            "Idempotency-Key": "idempotencyKey",
        },
    })
)
```

```rust Rust
use photon_ai_api::{Credential, PhotonClientBuilder, SecretString};

let token = std::env::var("PHOTON_API_TOKEN")?;
let client = PhotonClientBuilder::new()
    .credential("accountServiceKey", Credential::Bearer(SecretString::from(token)))
    .build()?;
let result = client
    .reset_account_profile_picture("idempotencyKey".to_owned())
    .await
    .map_err(|error| format!("{error:?}"))?
    .into_inner();
```

</RequestExample>

